{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevBeyondWindow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.KashaevBeyondWindow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevSaddleWindow","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KashaevTailBound"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_kashaevProd_left_beyond_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_kashaevProd_left_beyond_le","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevBeyondWindow.lean#L80-L118","doc":"**The left tail beyond the window**, valid inside the secant region\n`2N ≤ 3k` — which is where step 5's lower-bound chord holds and no further. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_kashaevProd_right_beyond_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.sum_kashaevProd_right_beyond_le","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevBeyondWindow.lean#L42-L78","doc":"**The right tail beyond the window.**  Everything from `k* + W + 1` up to\n`N`, bounded by `N` copies of the largest term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.mul_pred_le_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.mul_pred_le_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/KashaevBeyondWindow.lean#L34-L40","doc":"`d(d−1) ≥ (W+1)W` once `d ≥ W+1` — the step that turns a per-index tail\nbound into a uniform one. ","signatureChunk":0}]}